{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01U69tGd7KZV6J42anrQMuTx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016ohMYFDyJQvaP78ckQXxpd","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/pete/cadres/lattice/docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/results/R10.md","content":"# R10 — Result\n\n**Task:** Backend review — Phase 1 identity substrate\n**Date:** 2026-05-17\n**Status:** complete\n**Review verdict:** PASS-WITH-FOLLOWUP-TASK-T-followup-R10-A\n\n## Files created/modified\n\nCreated (in this task):\n\n- `docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/reviews/R10-identity.md`\n  — full review with mandatory sections `## Spec alignment`,\n  `## Coding-standard alignment`, `## P99 budget evidence`, `## Findings`,\n  `## Verdict`. 345 lines.\n- `docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T-followup-R10-A.md`\n  — follow-up task covering the four minor findings (F-1 through F-4).\n  The numeric slot `T11` was already used by Phase 2's event-model task, so\n  the existing build convention `T-followup-<review>-<letter>` (see\n  `tasks/T-followup-R05-A.md`) was followed.\n\nModified during review (then reverted to pre-review state):\n\n- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/budget_tests.rs` — temporarily\n  added `println!` lines inside `assert_within_budget` and the combined-workflow\n  test to capture measured P99 µs values for the `## P99 budget evidence`\n  section. Reverted after capture. Final file is byte-identical to T09 drop\n  (re-verified by a second `cargo test --release` run).\n\nSource files reviewed (not modified):\n\n- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/mod.rs` (32 lines)\n- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/kinds.rs` (174 lines)\n- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/encoding.rs` (329 lines)\n- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/ambiguity.rs` (97 lines)\n- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/resolver.rs` (732 lines)\n- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/serialization.rs` (319 lines)\n- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/tests.rs` (179 lines)\n- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/resolver_tests.rs` (366 lines)\n- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/budget_tests.rs` (235 lines)\n- `daemon/crates/lattice-core/src/identity/resolver/tests.rs` (141 lines — flagged as F-1 duplicate)\n- `daemon/crates/lattice-daemon/src/rpc/identity_payload.rs` (505 lines)\n\n## Verification commands and outputs\n\n### Task-spec verification (mandatory)\n\n| Command | Result |\n|---|---|\n| `test -f docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/reviews/R10-identity.md` | EXISTS |\n| `grep -q '## Spec alignment' docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/reviews/R10-identity.md` | FOUND |\n| `grep -q '## Coding-standard alignment' docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/reviews/R10-identity.md` | FOUND |\n| `grep -q '## P99 budget evidence' docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/reviews/R10-identity.md` | FOUND |\n| `grep -q '## Verdict' docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/reviews/R10-identity.md` | FOUND |\n\n### Review-procedure verification (steps 1–12 from R10.md)\n\n| Step | Command | Result |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 — Build | `cd daemon && cargo build --release` (after `touch crates/lattice-core/src/lib.rs` to force rebuild) | Clean. 0 warnings, 0 errors. Finished in 59.82 s. |\n| 2 — Identity unit tests | `cd daemon && cargo test -p lattice-core --lib identity::tests` | 10 passed, 0 failed, 0 ignored |\n| 2 — Resolver tests | `cd daemon && cargo test -p lattice-core --lib identity::resolver_tests` | 10 passed, 0 failed, 0 ignored |\n| 3 — Budget tests | `cd daemon && cargo test -p lattice-core --lib identity::budget_tests -- --include-ignored` | 4 passed, 0 failed |\n| 3 — Budget P99 capture (release) | `cd daemon && cargo test --release -p lattice-core --lib identity::budget_tests -- --include-ignored --nocapture --test-threads=1` (wi